INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('285','17','23','<p>The Surabaya Police have arrested a man, identified only as MN, for allegedly buying an infant via Instagram.</p>\r\n<p>MN was arrested at his house on Jl. Karah in Jambangan district in Surabaya, East Java, on Sunday. He was found to have paid some Rp3.8 million (US$250) for a baby boy when he was only three days old.</p>\r\n<p>Surabaya police chief Sr. Comr. Rudi Setiawan said recently that the transaction was conducted in Semarang, Central Java, on Sept. 23. The baby&rsquo;s parents live in Tangerang in Banten.</p>\r\n<p>\"The baby is now safe with the Surabaya administration,\" Rudi said on Monday (The Jakarta Post, Tue, October 16, 2018).</p>\r\n<p>The word &ldquo;<strong>infant</strong>&rdquo; has a similar meaning to ...</p>','1','<p>Adult</p>','<p>Teenager</p>','<p>New born</p>','<p>Grown</p>','<p>People</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('286','17','24','<p>The Surabaya Police have arrested a man, identified only as MN, for allegedly buying an infant via Instagram.</p>\r\n<p>MN was arrested at his house on Jl. Karah in Jambangan district in Surabaya, East Java, on Sunday. He was found to have paid some Rp3.8 million (US$250) for a baby boy when he was only three days old.</p>\r\n<p>Surabaya police chief Sr. Comr. Rudi Setiawan said recently that the transaction was conducted in Semarang, Central Java, on Sept. 23. The baby&rsquo;s parents live in Tangerang in Banten.</p>\r\n<p>\"The baby is now safe with the Surabaya administration,\" Rudi said on Monday (The Jakarta Post, Tue, October 16, 2018).</p>\r\n<p>\"MN was arrested at <strong>his</strong> house&hellip;\" The word <strong>\"his</strong>\" refers to a house belonging to ...</p>','1','<p>The police officer</p>','<p>The infant-parent</p>','<p>A Surabaya administration officer</p>','<p>The arrested man</p>','<p>The lawyer</p>','D','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('287','17','25','<p>Yogyakarta (JP)- National flag carrier Garuda Indonesia has temporarily diverted its flights intended for Adisucipto Airport in Yogyakarta to Adisumarmo Airport in Surakarta, Central Java after one of its planes overshot an Adisucipto runway lane on Wednesday night.</p>\r\n<p>\"All of Garuda Indonesia flights heading toward Yogyakarta, for a total of 34 flights, now will [be diverted] to Surakarta,\" Garuda Indonesia VP of corporate communications Benny S. Butarbutar said in an official statement on Thursday.</p>\r\n<p>The flights include 10 coming from and going to Jakarta, three to and from Denpasar, Bali, two to and from Makassar, South Sulawesi, and one flight from Surabaya, East Java.</p>\r\n<p>The airline would provide a bus at Adisumarmo Airport to transport passengers to Yogyakarta.</p>\r\n<p>Garuda Indonesia is still evacuating the Boeing 737-800 NG, which slipped on the runway and overshot a lane on Wednesday night. It carried 123 passengers, none of whom were harmed.Garuda aims to finish evacuating the aircraft on Thursday afternoon. (BBN)</p>\r\n<p>What is the text about?</p>','1','<p>Slipped plane accident in Adisucipto runway lane</p>','<p>Slipped plane accident in Adisucipto runway lane</p>','<p>Evacuation of Garuda Indonesia after its accident</p>','<p>Redirect flights of Garuda Indonesia from Yogyakarta to Surakarta because of runway accidents</p>','<p>The development of Garuda Indonesia</p>','D','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('288','17','26','<p>Yogyakarta (JP)- National flag carrier Garuda Indonesia has temporarily diverted its flights intended for Adisucipto Airport in Yogyakarta to Adisumarmo Airport in Surakarta, Central Java after one of its planes overshot an Adisucipto runway lane on Wednesday night.</p>\r\n<p>\"All of Garuda Indonesia flights heading toward Yogyakarta, for a total of 34 flights, now will [be diverted] to Surakarta,\" Garuda Indonesia VP of corporate communications Benny S. Butarbutar said in an official statement on Thursday.</p>\r\n<p>The flights include 10 coming from and going to Jakarta, three to and from Denpasar, Bali, two to and from Makassar, South Sulawesi, and one flight from Surabaya, East Java.</p>\r\n<p>The airline would provide a bus at Adisumarmo Airport to transport passengers to Yogyakarta.</p>\r\n<p>Garuda Indonesia is still evacuating the Boeing 737-800 NG, which slipped on the runway and overshot a lane on Wednesday night. It carried 123 passengers, none of whom were harmed.Garuda aims to finish evacuating the aircraft on Thursday afternoon. (BBN)</p>\r\n<p>It can be concluded from the text that ...</p>','1','<p>Adisucipto Airport will be closed after the incident.</p>','<p>Because of the incident, Garuda Indonesia permanently redirected Yogyakarta flights to Surakarta</p>','<p>Garuda Indonesia supplied buses to support passengers from Surakarta to Yogyakarta</p>','<p>Garuda Indonesia had finished evacuating its plane when this news was reported</p>','<p>Garuda Indonesia rescheduled the flights</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('289','17','27','<p>Yogyakarta (JP)- National flag carrier Garuda Indonesia has temporarily diverted its flights intended for Adisucipto Airport in Yogyakarta to Adisumarmo Airport in Surakarta, Central Java after one of its planes overshot an Adisucipto runway lane on Wednesday night.</p>\r\n<p>\"All of Garuda Indonesia flights heading toward Yogyakarta, for a total of 34 flights, now will [be diverted] to Surakarta,\" Garuda Indonesia VP of corporate communications Benny S. Butarbutar said in an official statement on Thursday.</p>\r\n<p>The flights include 10 coming from and going to Jakarta, three to and from Denpasar, Bali, two to and from Makassar, South Sulawesi, and one flight from Surabaya, East Java.</p>\r\n<p>The airline would provide a bus at Adisumarmo Airport to transport passengers to Yogyakarta.</p>\r\n<p>Garuda Indonesia is still evacuating the Boeing 737-800 NG, which slipped on the runway and overshot a lane on Wednesday night. It carried 123 passengers, none of whom were harmed.Garuda aims to finish evacuating the aircraft on Thursday afternoon. (BBN)</p>\r\n<p>The reason why Garuda Indonesia diverted Yogyakarta flights to Surakarta is because of ...</p>','1','<p>The accident of its plane which slipped on the runway lane.</p>','<p>Maintenance of one of Garuda Indonesia&rsquo;s aircraft</p>','<p>Many flights at Adisucipto Airport</p>','<p>The statement of Garuda Indonesia VP of corporate communications</p>','<p>Emergency situation at the airport</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('290','17','28','<p>New York &mdash; At least ten people were killed and several others were injured when a massive fire broke out in an apartment building in the Bronx, New York, on Sunday.</p>\r\n<p>Firefighters said the blaze started on the second floor of the five-story building around 9:00 AM. Thick black smoke quickly filled the stairwells, trapping many residents inside before help arrived.</p>\r\n<p>Fire department officials stated that the cause of the fire is still under investigation. However, preliminary reports indicate an electrical short circuit might have triggered the fire.</p>\r\n<p>What is the text mainly about ?</p>','1','<p>A massive fire in a New York apartment killed at least ten people.</p>','<p>Firefighters successfully rescued all residents in the Bronx</p>','<p>An electrical short circuit is the official cause of the fire</p>','<p>Ten firefighters were injured during a rescue mission in New York</p>','<p>Investigating about the cause of fire</p>','A','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('291','17','29','<p>New York &mdash; At least ten people were killed and several others were injured when a massive fire broke out in an apartment building in the Bronx, New York, on Sunday.</p>\r\n<p>Firefighters said the blaze started on the second floor of the five-story building around 9:00 AM. Thick black smoke quickly filled the stairwells, trapping many residents inside before help arrived.</p>\r\n<p>Fire department officials stated that the cause of the fire is still under investigation. However, preliminary reports indicate an electrical short circuit might have triggered the fire.</p>\r\n<p>Where did the incident happen?</p>','1','<p>On the second floor of a house</p>','<p>In an apartment building in the Bronx, New York</p>','<p>At a local office building in New York</p>','<p>In a five-story hotel in the Bronx</p>','<p>In the security office</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('292','17','30','<p>New York &mdash; At least ten people were killed and several others were injured when a massive fire broke out in an apartment building in the Bronx, New York, on Sunday.</p>\r\n<p>Firefighters said the blaze started on the second floor of the five-story building around 9:00 AM. Thick black smoke quickly filled the stairwells, trapping many residents inside before help arrived.</p>\r\n<p>Fire department officials stated that the cause of the fire is still under investigation. However, preliminary reports indicate an electrical short circuit might have triggered the fire.</p>\r\n<p>Based on the text, what might have caused the fire?</p>','1','<p>gas leak in the kitchen.</p>','<p>A burning cigarette</p>','<p>An electrical short circuit</p>','<p>A lightning strike</p>','<p>A terrorist</p>','C','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('293','17','2','<p>99 Shopping Precinct &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>New Castle</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>October 12, 2025</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Jon Snow</p>\r\n<p>HR Manager of Eagle Airways</p>\r\n<p>795 Burke Rd.</p>\r\n<p>New Castle</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dear Mr. Snow,</p>\r\n<p>I am writing to <strong><u>apply for</u></strong> the Marketing Manager position advertised in The Daily News on October 10, 2025. With a degree in Business Administration and three years of experience in digital marketing, I am confident in my ability to bring value to your company.</p>\r\n<p>My tasks among other are building good relationship with distributors and customers, and providing inputs for the company about pricing policies, marketing strategies, and customer satisfaction. I have enclosed my resume and a recent photograph for your review.</p>\r\n<p>I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with the needs of Eagle Company. Thank you for your time and consideration.</p>\r\n<p>Yours sincerely,</p>\r\n<p>Harry Clarks</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Where did the applican\'t know the job vacancy from?</p>','1','<p>Nusantara Corp office</p>','<p>The Daily News</p>','<p>John Doe\'s email</p>','<p>A business administration university</p>','<p>Social media advertisement</p>','B','','','','','','','');
INSERT INTO `soal` VALUES ('294','17','8','<p>M.Yamin Street No.4 Solo</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>March 4, 2016</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Director of English Speak Well</p>\r\n<p>Surabaya</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>On this good opportunity, I would like to apply for the content writer in your company. My name is Prisilia Budianti, 25 years old, female, single, energetic and healthy. I graduated from UNS on August 2015. I would like to have career to expand my experience.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As requested, I am enclosing a completed job application, my resume, and three references.I am a hard worker and want to learn more type of person. I will be very appreciated if you could give in opportunity to work in your company.Herewith I <strong><u>enclose</u></strong> my curriculum vitae, which will give details of my qualification.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>I can be reached anytime via cell phone, 087 0123 4567.I hope my qualifications and working experiences could be your consideration and look forward to your reply.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sincerely yours,</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Prisilia Budianti .</p>\r\n<p>What should the recipient do if he/ she wants to look for the details of the applicant&rsquo;s qualification?</p>','1','<p>Read the enclosed resume</p>','<p>Send Prisilia email</p>','<p>Come to Prisilia\'s house</p>','<p>Call Prisialia</p>','<p>Ask Prisilia directly</p>','D','','','','','','','');
